.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
LivingDioramaYF/Intermediate/
LivingDioramaYF/Saved/
LivingDioramaYF/DerivedDataCache/
LivingDioramaYF/Binaries/
*.fcd.xml

# Phase 2: imported City Sample content (Epic Content License) is reproduced by
# CACHE/import_city_sample_subset.py from EVIDENCE/PHASE_02/import_manifest.json;
# it is never committed. Our own authored assets live under Content/PCG and Content/LD.
LivingDioramaYF/Content/*
!LivingDioramaYF/Content/PCG/
!LivingDioramaYF/Content/LD/
# LS_Look.uasset is render scratch: tools_look.py and tools_peek.py recreate
# it from nothing on every preview, nine commits hold nine different blobs,
# no intentional version exists anywhere in its history, and no level, MRQ
# config or production module reads it. It was swept into three unrelated
# commits by a careless `git add -A`. LS_Preview is NOT scratch -- it is
# built by ldyf/unreal/ldyf_preview.py and shipped -- and stays tracked.
LivingDioramaYF/Content/LD/LS_Look.uasset
# Phase 4: the factory builds one Level Sequence per shot (LS_P4_<beat>) and
# deletes it after the shot is rendered (ldyf/factory/render.py remove_shot).
# One exists on disk only while a shot renders; its sha256 is sealed in that
# shot's shot_render.json. Never content to commit.
LivingDioramaYF/Content/LD/LS_P4_*.uasset
LivingDioramaYF/Plugins/*/Content/
LivingDioramaYF/DerivedDataCache/
LivingDioramaYF/Intermediate/
LivingDioramaYF/Saved/
